01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Pirate Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Here is a sample of my Pirate voiceover. One of the featured voices on my website as I'm asked for it so much.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Captain of this style</h2>\r\n<p>Looking for a great pirate? Let ye treasure be a booking with my pirate voiceover. The TV ad for this great game called Pirate Bridge aired on TV in 2013. The pirate voice is one of the regular voice styles I'm asked for, along with my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\"  title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voice</a> and my <a href=\"/santa-voice\"  title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voice</a>.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Egnp8ZWrojI","title":"Pirate Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/pirate-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Pirate Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>Voice of a Pirate</h2>\r\n<p>Yarrrrrgh! Working with some great brand names, I've been asked to voice for some really fun projects including <a href=\"/lego-minifigures-pirate\" title=\"Lego Pirates Voiceover\">Lego Pirates</a>, <a href=\"/pop-up-pirate-voiceover\" title=\"Popup Pirate Game Voiceover\">Popup Pirate</a> and <a href=\"/cbbc-pirate-week-voice\"  title=\"CBeebies Pirate Week Voiceover\">CBeebies' Pirate Week</a>.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If I can help provide you with a pirate voice for your next <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a>, let me know more details about the project and usage so that I can better quote. Please get in touch if you'd like to work with me. I'd be very happy to send a short sample of your script before you book me. \r\nPlease send a few lines of the script first so you can be sure I'm right for your brand. \r\nI make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Pirate Voiceover","pageUrl":"pirate-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","674",{"href":"/eze-group-explainer-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/eze-group-explainer-voice.jpg","alt":"Eze Group Explainer Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Eze Group Explainer Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3","861",{"href":"/logo-board-game-hovis-and-sailor-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/logo-board-game-hovis-and-sailor-voice.jpg","alt":"logo